[{"category":"section","location":"news/#News-for-EOptInterface-Releases","page":"News","text":"","title":"News for EOptInterface Releases"},{"category":"section","location":"news/#[v0.2.0](https://github.com/PSORLab/EOptInterface.jl/releases/tag/v0.2.0)-(June-19,-2026)","page":"News","text":"Bumped ModelingToolkit.jl compatibility to v11.","title":"v0.2.0 (June 19, 2026)"},{"category":"section","location":"news/#[v0.1.1](https://github.com/PSORLab/EOptInterface.jl/releases/tag/v0.1.1)-(April-22,-2026)","page":"News","text":"Added notebook examples.\nRenamed full_solutions to full_solution.\nSeparated tests.\nAdded documentation website.","title":"v0.1.1 (April 22, 2026)"},{"category":"section","location":"news/#[v0.1.0](https://github.com/PSORLab/EOptInterface.jl/releases/tag/v0.1.0)-(Jan-20,-2026)","page":"News","text":"Initial release.","title":"v0.1.0 (Jan 20, 2026)"},{"category":"section","location":"#EOptInterface","page":"API Reference","text":"Documentation for EOptInterface.\n\n","title":"EOptInterface"},{"category":"method","location":"#EOptInterface.decision_vars-Tuple{ModelingToolkitBase.System}","page":"API Reference","text":"decision_vars(\n    sys::ModelingToolkitBase.System\n) -> Vector{SymbolicUtils.BasicSymbolicImpl.var\"typeof(BasicSymbolicImpl)\"{SymbolicUtils.SymReal}}\n\n\nReturns the decision variables for an optimization problem from a  ModelingToolkit.System.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"EOptInterface.decision_vars"},{"category":"method","location":"#EOptInterface.full_solution-Tuple{JuMP.Model, ModelingToolkitBase.System}","page":"API Reference","text":"full_solution(\n    model::JuMP.Model,\n    sys::ModelingToolkitBase.System\n) -> Dict{Any, Any}\n\n\nReturns a dictionary of optimal solution values for the observed variables of a  ModelingToolkit.System if the JuMP.Model is solved.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"EOptInterface.full_solution"},{"category":"method","location":"#EOptInterface.register_nlsystem-Tuple{JuMP.Model, ModelingToolkitBase.System, Symbolics.Num, Vector{Symbolics.Num}}","page":"API Reference","text":"register_nlsystem(\n    model::JuMP.Model,\n    sys::ModelingToolkitBase.System,\n    obj::Symbolics.Num,\n    ineqs::Vector{Symbolics.Num}\n)\n\n\nAutomatically formulates and adds user-provided Symbolics.Num objective  function and Vector{Symbolics.Num} constraints from a ModelingToolkit.System  to a JuMP.Model.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"EOptInterface.register_nlsystem"},{"category":"method","location":"#EOptInterface.register_nlsystem-Tuple{JuMP.Model, ModelingToolkitBase.System, Symbolics.Num}","page":"API Reference","text":"register_nlsystem(\n    model::JuMP.Model,\n    sys::ModelingToolkitBase.System,\n    obj::Symbolics.Num\n)\n\n\nAutomatically formulates and adds a user-provided Symbolics.Num objective  function from a ModelingToolkit.System to a JuMP.Model.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"EOptInterface.register_nlsystem"},{"category":"method","location":"#EOptInterface.register_odesystem-Tuple{JuMP.Model, ModelingToolkitBase.System, Tuple{Real, Real}, Real, String}","page":"API Reference","text":"register_odesystem(\n    model::JuMP.Model,\n    sys::ModelingToolkitBase.System,\n    tspan::Tuple{Real, Real},\n    tstep::Real,\n    integrator::String\n)\n\n\nAutomatically applies specified direct transcription method and registers the  discretized ODE ModelingToolkit.System as algebraic JuMP constraints. Currently supports Explicit Euler \"EE\" and Implicit Euler \"IE\".\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"EOptInterface.register_odesystem"}]
